sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Skipper
    participant L as lifecycle.skip
    participant R as Redis
    participant B as Partner

    A->>L: skip
    L->>R: heartbeat(sid)  → state + matchId
    alt no match, SEARCHING
        L-->>A: queue_status SEARCHING
    else no match, IDLE
        L-->>A: queue_status IDLE
    else matched
        L->>R: endMatch.lua → endMatchInline
        Note over R: DEL kMatch — only the caller whose DEL<br/>returns 1 is the winner (D6)
        Note over R: writes chat:last_partner for BOTH sides<br/>(120s late-block window)
        Note over R: DEL both user_match · SREM both from queue ·<br/>state=IDLE · DEL dedupe
        alt this caller won
            L->>L: retention.enqueue(conversation_ended, reason='skip')
            L->>B: partner_skipped
        else lost the race
            Note over L: silent. The peer is already being told.
        end
        L->>L: joinQueue(sid)   ← re-enters immediately
    end
